/*@meta

Author:
'Sound Dust'

Description:
'Beware, randy geese!\r\nHold notes and wait'

Usage:
'MW movement\r\nAT bend'

Categories:
'Pads:Atonal, Pads:Drones, Pads:Evolving, Pads:Soundscape, FX:Noise & Rumble'

